[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    10[0m:[38;5;10m[49m (`src/lib.c:105-114`) has 3 valid arms + `default`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    11[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis E — entry points (all 12, including the lowest-level ones).**
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    13[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Level 0 (leaf): `c2V`, `c2Sub`, `c2Dot`, `c2Mulvs`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    14[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Level 1: `c2Maxv`, `c2Minv`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Level 2: `c2Clampv`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Level 3: `c2CircletoCircle`, `c2CircletoAABB`, `c2CircletoCapsule`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Level 4 (dispatcher): `c2Collided`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    18[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Level 5 (convenience one-shot): `circle_collide` — the only symbol in `lib.h`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Phase B drives levels 0→5 directly, not just level 5.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis B — control-flow shapes the code special-cases.**
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `c2Maxv`/`c2Minv`: 2 independent ternaries × {taken, not-taken} = 4 shapes each.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `c2CircletoCapsule`: 3 mutually exclusive arms — `da < 0`, `da ≥ 0 && db < 0`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   (the projection arm with the division), `da ≥ 0 && db ≥ 0`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `c2Circleto*`: predicate `d2 < r2` on each side of the boundary, plus exact
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    26[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   equality (`d2 == r2` ⇒ false).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    27[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    28[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis V — value shapes for the `float` payloads.**
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    29[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `normal`, `zero (+0/-0)`, `subnormal`, `huge (near MAX ⇒ overflow in c2Dot)`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    30[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `±inf`, `NaN (quiet, and with payload/sign bits set)`, `mixed`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    31[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    32[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis S — geometric input shapes.**
